TITLE: Get All Cookies in a Next.js Server Component
DESCRIPTION: This example shows how to retrieve all available cookies within a Next.js Server Component. It uses the `(await cookies()).getAll()` method to return an array of all cookies, which can then be iterated over to access their names and values.

